WEBVTT

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.500
Why can't I stop crying?

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.010
Because of the onions.

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.710
My eyes hurt.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.260
Tell me when you're ready.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.500
Why don't you help us?

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.840
But I'm exhausted from the drive.

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:39.600
I guess.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:42.860
But you're the one who suggested this.

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:47.150
'Tis the season for food and leisure. This is great.

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:52.540
If this were a movie, we'd be murdered for camping in a place like this.

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.860
We already did that.

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:17.090
Wings.

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:19.110
A dragon.

00:02:54.250 --> 00:03:01.210
"Adult's Ritual"

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:05.290
What was that?

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:06.510
What strong wind.

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:08.550
I can't see.

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:14.400
Ryuji-kun, where's your Slash Breath?

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:15.780
Inside the car.

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:18.420
So is my stick.

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:21.770
I hope she's like Maruga.

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:24.370
You're Kisaragi Ryuji?

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:26.750
That's right.

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:30.520
I'm Sapphie. As you can see, I'm a blue dragon.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:31.950
A blue dragon?

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:36.090
You'll pay for what you did to my Onyx!

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:37.840
Onyx?

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.180
Onyx?

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:40.760
I'll have my revenge!

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:50.560
Huh?

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:52.230
What?

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.790
That's weird. The waves were supposed to be bigger.

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:59.190
Who are you?

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:02.140
I told you, I'm Sapphie the blue dragon.

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:03.630
What did you come here to do?

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:06.850
I came to get revenge for Onyx.

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:10.520
I'm his future bride.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.720
He had a lover?

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:14.690
But he tried to marry Rose.

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:18.930
Well, we happen to be living together.

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:21.970
What? You mean he revived?

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.850
He just won't give up.

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:25.520
What's that supposed to mean?

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:27.730
You were the ones who started it.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:29.510
I won't hold back this time.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:31.760
Prepare yourselves!

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:45.950
Witness the power of the blue dragon.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:57.120
Do you get it now? I have full control over water...

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.430
Hey, you.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:01.790
What do you think you're doing?

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:14.570
You'll pay for this!

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:28.920
That girl...

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:32.300
Are you okay?

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:33.790
Ryuji!

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:41.130
That blue dragon ruined everything.

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:44.420
That girl was a dragon?

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:47.420
Seemed like it, but unlike Rose...

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:52.040
Rose-chan is a dragon?

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:53.530
Yeah, that's right.

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:54.740
Rose!

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:03.640
That's why that girl flew away.

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:06.790
Can you fly, too?

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:11.420
Please don't tell anyone.

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:15.830
I promised Ryuji I wouldn't let anyone know I'm a dragon.

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:17.260
I see.

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:20.780
Okay. I won't tell anyone.

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:23.250
Thank you.

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:30.230
Well, you know, it would have been impossible to hide it forever.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.690
It's okay. Misaki-chan will keep her promise.

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:37.140
We fought inside that painting together.

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:41.000
That's fine, but...

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:44.300
Eto-san, sorry. We're counting on you.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:46.300
Okay.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:49.020
By the way, I'm a wolf person.

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:51.240
Why'd you have to say that?

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:53.100
A wolf?

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.940
Give yourself up, Black Cowboy.

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:03.710
Your plan to turn all of Japan into a ranch has failed.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:05.310
Please do not cause Onyx any trouble.

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:06.400
We've contacted the police.

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:12.770
Kisaragi Ryuji and the red dragon were powerful enough to wound him severely.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:16.800
You lack offensive powers.

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:21.680
If you're captured and handed over the society, you'll only cause more trouble.

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:23.610
I won't be caught.

00:07:23.610 --> 00:07:25.870
No one flies faster than me.

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:29.200
If I get in trouble, I'll blast them away with water and come back.

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:34.240
Didn't you prove today you don't have the power to do that?

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:36.770
You really are mean.

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:38.650
You're simply too immature.

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:42.140
I'm not a kid. I underwent my coming of age ritual.

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:45.200
I understand.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:48.650
Onyx belongs to me.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.980
I have a message from Onyx.

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:56.880
"I'll be gone for two days. Do not leave."

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.840
"Kids should play at home."

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:04.100
Did he really say that last part?

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:06.170
Yes, he did.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.270
Fine, I'll be good.

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:19.290
Ryuji, why didn't you invite me to your barbecue party?

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:23.910
Didn't you know I'm the youngest honorary president of the American BBQ Federation?

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:25.550
He's not here.

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:27.110
But Rose-chan is here.

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:31.670
That's odd.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:34.950
Ryuji-kun has something to do today.

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:35.570
Yeah.

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:38.990
Is that why Ryuji-kun asked you to look after her?

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:41.550
No, Eriko-san asked me to do it.

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:46.080
What do you think you're doing?

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:48.370
Since when do you have a peace treaty with your rival?

00:08:48.980 --> 00:08:51.980
We're not rivals. We're friends.

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:57.070
Is it a party? Another party today?

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:58.780
He's such a party animal.

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:01.670
What sort of party is it, Ryuji?

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:11.970
I see. The young dragon girl isn't here today.

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:16.110
I'm sorry, Ishizu-san. Perhaps another day.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:20.240
I'll be returning to Germany soon, so there's no need.

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:24.910
Ryuji-kun, if you ever find yourself in Europe, be sure to stop by.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.380
I will, thank you.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:28.990
Good bye.

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:35.260
It's a shame all collectors can't be gentlemen like Ishizu-san.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:39.230
Are you okay? You could have stayed home with Rose.

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:46.240
No, it's the inauguration for the building Onyx destroyed.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:48.820
Besides, it's a good opportunity.

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:54.420
I want to know what the society is up to for Rose's sake.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:59.630
Be careful. Some people here have fangs and tails.

00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:04.660
Rose isn't their only target. Plenty of people are after you, the level 10 breaker.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.090
Okay.

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:09.780
Ryuji-kun, it's good to see you.

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:12.690
Tokura-san, it's good to see you again.

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:15.610
You wore your lab coat to an event like this?

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:17.310
It's brand new.

00:10:17.310 --> 00:10:18.990
You've already met each other?

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:23.020
Yes. I'll be working at his lab starting the day after tomorrow.

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:25.760
But Tokura-san, you're a dragon researcher.

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:30.000
Of course. I intend to devote my energies to researching dragons.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:34.740
Don't worry.

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:39.650
Onyx left a mountain of skin and cells.

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:42.760
I have no plans to meddle with Rose-san.

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:44.500
I see.

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:48.250
No other branch has acquired so many dragon samples.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:51.900
It's also the reason they were able to rebuild so quickly.

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:54.370
Dragons bring in the cash.

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:56.020
Bianca!

00:10:56.020 --> 00:11:01.140
Don't worry. I'm only interested in you and Lost Preciouses.

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:06.790
If he's up to something, you'll be the first to know.

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:12.400
Please don't say such things openly.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:15.380
Please try to keep your voice down.

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:22.420
Shall I walk you to your apartment?

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:24.580
I can make it home by myself.

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:26.580
Bye.

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:33.740
Misaki, thank you for not telling anyone.

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:37.910
I appreciate it. See you tomorrow.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:40.290
Okay. See you tomorrow.

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:02.470
We meet again, red dragon.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:05.010
You're the girl from the camping trip.

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:07.280
Weren't you listening?

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:12.630
Blue dragon Sapphie!

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:16.350
You tried to hurt Ryuji.

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:18.570
I'm getting revenge for Onyx.

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:22.330
I will protect Ryuji.

00:12:22.850 --> 00:12:27.500
This isn't what I'm after, but I'll play with you a little bit.

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:48.600
How did this happen?

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:50.500
I'll leave a change of clothes here.

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:52.540
Oh, thanks.

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:55.900
I mean, stop taking care of me!

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:05.890
I hate you, Rose.

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:09.680
But Onyx likes you.

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:14.100
A woman never does anything to upset the man she loves.

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:16.790
You're lucky.

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:19.220
I'm not interesting in Onyx.

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:21.330
I only love Ryuji.

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:23.200
Isn't he human?

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:26.490
Human or dragon, it doesn't matter.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:28.310
We engaged.

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:32.560
You engaged with a human? Are you out of your mind?

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:36.960
Have you ever met another dragon?

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.660
Just Onyx and Maruga.

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:44.130
We didn't talk much about being dragons, so I don't know.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:47.500
I only left my nest recently.

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:51.380
I suppose you wouldn't know the way of the world.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:54.510
I've already been out five years.

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:56.160
That's amazing.

00:13:56.790 --> 00:14:00.690
You don't look like you've done your coming of age ritual.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.330
Coming of age ritual?

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:04.790
I knew it. That's why you're still a kid.

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:09.100
Have you had Ryuji kiss you here?

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:16.630
I had Onyx do it. That's the coming of age ritual.

00:14:16.630 --> 00:14:18.850
It means he chose me.

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:22.020
That's why I'm Onyx's lover.

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:23.520
I'm an adult.

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:26.210
How are adults and children different?

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:30.110
Men won't pay attention to you if you're not an adult.

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:31.970
That's not true.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:36.640
Ryuji and I sleep together, and we hug all the time.

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:41.400
That's proof he just thinks of you as a kid.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:45.800
If he really liked you, he'd be too embarrassed to do that.

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:54.500
To be honest, it'd be convenient for me for you to end up with Ryuji.

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:58.370
Then I would receive all of Onyx's attention.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:01.430
Is becoming an adult a good thing?

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:05.900
Of course it is. My heart pounds at the sight of him.

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:08.910
It makes me feel like I'm in heaven.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:12.110
You won't understand until you are one.

00:15:13.940 --> 00:15:17.760
If you don't grow up, someone else will take him from you.

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:19.610
I don't want that!

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:23.220
I want to become an adult. What do I do?

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:30.990
You know what to do.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:32.980
Yeah.

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:36.480
Then make Ryuji yours.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:39.510
I'll be back. See you later.

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:42.770
See you later.

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:44.520
I'm home.

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:47.620
Home, sweet home.

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:49.760
This is my home.

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:54.130
Ryuji, Ryuji.

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:55.940
I'm back.

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:56.900
Ryuji.

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:59.430
Make me an adult.

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:03.260
What?

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:08.960
You shouldn't have let her in. She works with Onyx.

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.540
I'm sorry.

00:16:11.020 --> 00:16:14.080
But she didn't seem like a bad girl.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:17.410
You must have let your guard down because she's around your age.

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:22.570
What is the coming of age ritual?

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:25.610
It's a ritual to become an adult.

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:30.150
It's really simple, and everyone our age is doing it.

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:31.960
So, please.

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:37.290
You mean becoming a full grown dragon like Onyx and Maruga?

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:40.140
No, but...

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:45.510
It's not on the society's secret page. Could it be a dragon custom?

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:46.650
We should ask Maruga...

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:48.010
No!

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:51.790
I just want to do it.

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:55.740
It's not dangerous, is it?

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:57.280
No, it's not.

00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:59.230
You're going to do it?

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.350
We might as well, right?

00:17:05.030 --> 00:17:06.840
You want me to kiss you here?

00:17:07.990 --> 00:17:09.020
Yeah.

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:20.070
Rose?

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:25.740
Rose!

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:28.280
What's wrong?

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:30.280
So hot.

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:32.630
Ryuji.

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:33.900
What?

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:37.850
Will you accept me?

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:40.230
Sure.

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:46.840
Are you okay?

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:51.010
Rose.

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:59.040
What's wrong? Does something hurt?

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:01.400
Don't touch me!

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:05.430
Rose, are you hurt?

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:09.480
No. If you touch me now...

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:12.050
Don't touch me!

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:16.010
I'm okay.

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:24.100
I'm sure it's nothing to worry about.

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:26.620
Let me handle it.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:31.450
What am I going to do? Something's wrong with me.

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:34.670
There, there. Don't cry.

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:39.330
What if Ryuji hates me? I told him not to touch me.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:42.420
That won't happen. It's okay.

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:46.950
I love him. I really love Ryuji...

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:50.060
but it burns when he touches me.

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:52.530
Just looking at him.

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:55.270
Becoming an adult, huh?

00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:58.740
So this is the dragon's coming of age ritual.

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:01.930
Eriko, what happened to me?

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:09.050
I think you became a girl.

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:12.110
Just like Ryuji-kun is a boy.

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:15.480
You finally recognize each other as members of the opposite sex.

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:18.680
Are we that different?

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:24.940
You've always loved Ryuji, but now that you've moved to the next stage...

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:27.290
your body and heart is full of uncertainty.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.040
What am I going to do?

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:33.070
Don't worry. You'll get used to it soon.

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:34.750
Really?

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:36.200
Really.

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:42.210
Go to sleep. I'll explain things to Ryuji-kun.

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:45.340
Eriko.

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:46.490
What is it?

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:50.050
Ryuji doesn't hate me, does he?

00:19:50.050 --> 00:19:53.200
He's not mad at me for telling him not to touch me, is he?

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:59.410
It's okay. He was just shocked because it happened so suddenly.

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:00.750
Just like you.

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:01.930
I see.

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:05.890
Tell me if he's mad. I'll go apologize right away.

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:07.140
Promise me.

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:11.060
It'll be fine. Just go to sleep, okay?

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:17.320
Ryuji.

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:21.620
Eriko-san, what happened to Rose? Is she okay?

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:25.630
Now I have to deal with this one. What a pain.

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:28.920
Was I wrong to kiss her?

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:33.070
No, this is all Sapphie's fault.

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:36.470
If she shows up again, I'll teach her a lesson.

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:41.570
Where is the thief?

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:46.740
He escaped. No one saw what he looked like.

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:49.460
What do you mean?

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:54.150
Not a single volume was stolen. Who would do this?

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:58.520
All the books scattered about are prohibited reading.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:20:59.880
Wait.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:05.360
The black dragon Onyx.

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:16.240
I think it's something like human secondary sex characteristics.

