Didn't she seem more immature than she looked?

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:22.210
Now she's finally balanced.

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:28.960
It seemed like a pretty natural reaction for a girl to have towards a boy she likes.

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:34.290
What am I supposed to do?

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:36.170
Ryuji.

00:21:45.210 --> 00:21:46.480
Good morning.

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:50.810
Good morning.

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:39.960
Next episode "Dragon Crisis"

00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:27.880
